    "turn_idx": 27,
    "turn_text": "I'd say that. Maybe the blessing of salesmanship when you're on Main Street, who aren't having a good nose for a market that's going to grow in value. And that's a metaphorical way of describing it. But that's basically what I had to do. They had tried for two years to get the first Republican to cross the threshold. I don't calculate political risk like most do here. I term limited myself. I wouldn't do it more than two terms anyway. It gives me a lot of freedom to speak my mind and stick to my principles.",
