        "text": "Punitive measures ('the stick') and incentives ('the carrot') represent distinct, opposing strategies in public policy.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Washington refers specifically to influential political or bureaucratic actors involved in program design and execution.",
